      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūhaya gīkī, “Ī numba ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu īkūbiza henaha, nū ng'walīlo gwa shitambò sha kūpemva kūlwa nguno ya Baisilaeli gūkūbiza henaha nago.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shikolo sha nzenga ya hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Daūdi ūlagīja būkumingwa pye abo baalī batī Baisilaeli abo bikalaga ū mu Isilaeli; hūna ū kūfuma ū mubo ūsolanhya bapondagūji ba mawe, ba kūbeegeleja mawe ga kūzengela numba ya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūfunya chūma shingī kūlwa kūbeegeja misumaali ya kūlūnganīja mbawa ja ha milyango ya ha mibita; na kūlūnganīja mapandī gangī ayo gaalī gigeleelilwe kūlūnganyiwa; ūbinha na shaba ningī no, īyo būdito wayo walī būtadūgije nūūlū kūmanīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūfunya na mitī mingī ya miyenze-yenze, nayo yalī ītī na būbalīlwe; nguno a bana Sidoni na a bana Tulo baalī bang'wenhela mitī mingī no ū Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūhaya, “Ū ng'witūnja wane ū Solomoni ataalī ndo no, hama ataalī kūmana mihayo mingī; alīyo ī numba īyo īlazengwe kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA shiigelile ībize yawiza jigi, hama ībize na lūkumo lwawiza n'ikūjo itaale ū mu mahanga gose; na lūūlū nakwīgolanīja pye ī shikolo īsho shiigeleelilwe.” Na ng'hana ū Daūdi aho ataalī kūcha akabeeja milonjo mitaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'witana ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Solomoni, ūnganikīla īyo yigelile ayīīte kūlwa kūnzengela numba ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Solomoni gīkī, “Ng'wana wane, ū mu ng'holò yane līkilonga iganiko lya kūzenga numba kūlwa nguno ya lina lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo gūnizīīla mhayo kūfuma kūlī SEEBA gūlīniwīla gīkī, ‘Ū bebe wita mininga mingī no, nū būlūgū walwa wingī no, na lūūlū yaya ū kūzenga ī numba kūlwa lina lyane, nguno mining mingī no ayo wagiita ha sī ū kū būtongi wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūkūbyala ng'wana, ūyo akūbiza munhū wa mhola na kwifuula; nakūng'winha kwifuula kūfuma ū kū banishi bakwe hose-hose abo bampīndije mhandī jose. Ī lina lyakwe akūbiza Solomoni; ū mu shikū jakwe nakūtūūla mhola na būlembeezu ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyo hū ng'wene akūzenga numba kūlwa lina lyane. Akūbiza ng'wana wane, nū nene nakūbiza Ise. Ū būtemi wakwe ū kū Baisilaeli nakūwīta būshinge ho kūshisha welelo bose.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū ng'wana wane, ū Seba ni abizage hamò nang'ho, hama ūbize na kwīlūkīlwa kwawiza wīzenge ī numba ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako gīt'ūmo ahayīlile gīkī ūkwīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ni akwinhage witegeleja na masala, ūlū alakwīte kūbiza nūsugi wa Baisilaeli; ūbize na būdūla wa kūshidima ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū ūbiza ng'witegeleja ū mu kūshidima ī shilagīlo na malange ga ng'wa SEEBA ayo akang'winha Musa kūlwa nguno ya Baisilaeli, a henaho hū ūkūdūla ū kwīyīīta ī yose. Bizaga na nguzu, hangī ūbize ng'wiyūmīlīja; yaya ū kogoha nūūlū kūgwa ng'holò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene naakoyile nago ū nīmo gwa kūkuminga ī shizengelo sha hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, alīyo ī haha nasūmbije zahabu ningī, tani shihūmbī shidatū na magana mpungatī na makūmi atanò; na feza tani shihūmbī makūmi adatū na mpungatī na magana atanò. Ī shaba nī chūma ī shene shilī shingī no, shilambu nū kūbūmana ū būdito washo; pye nī mitī na a mawe, nū bebe ūkongeleleja lūūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami abo ūlī nabo a bene bingī no: baakoolī ba kūponda mawe, bazengi na baselemala; nīyo ūlī na banhū bamani ba kūtūmama milīmo ya būlī mbika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balīho abo badeebile kūbeeja shikolo sha zahabu na sha feza, sha shaba na sha chūma; nīyo a baakoolī a bene bingī no, lweelwe ndo. Ali lūūlū gwandyage ū nīmo, SEEBA abize hamò nang'ho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūbakomeleja batongeeji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Daūdi ūbakomeleja pye a batongeeji ba Baisilaeli kūngunanha ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla gīkī, “Bīng'we, ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we atī hamò ning'we? Ataalī kūng'winha kwifuula hose-hose ū kū mapandī ayo gamupīndīlīgije? Nguno pye a bajiga-jiga ba mu sī īyī wabatūūlile mu nkono gwane, ī haha ī sī yenīyī īlī ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa SEEBA, hamò na banhū bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, a bīng'we ifunyagi gete ū būpanga wing'we; ī ng'holò jing'we jinkoobe ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. Andyagi ū kūzenga ī lipandī lyeela kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu, mulyenhe ī lisandīko lya būlagane wa ng'wa SEEBA, nī shikolo ī shingī ī sheela, īsho shilī sabo ya ng'wa SEEBA; mushitūūle mu hekalu īyo īlazengwe kūlwa lina lya ng'wa SEEBA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
